Subject: renderer: MECHA_GLES_DEVICE overrides the DRM render node

On GPUs without 3D (QEMU virtio-gpu without host GL), GBM can only allocate dumb
buffers, which render nodes refuse; such systems point this at a primary node
(/dev/dri/card0). The rewritten gles crate on `dev` has the same render-node-only
lookup (crates/gles/src/egl.rs render_node) and needs the same opt-in.

Upstream: mecha-org/mecha-wayland, against main f43c416.

